{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38857","headline":"冬末自长沙游桂岭留献所知 · 杜荀鹤","name":"冬末自长沙游桂岭留献所知","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家隔重湖归未期，更堪南去别深知。\n前程笑到山多处，上马愁逢岁尽时。\n四海内无容足地，一生中有苦心诗。\n朱门秪见朱门事，独把孤寒问阿谁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38857.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38857","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}